+	expected = `
+
+Diff:
+--- Expected
++++ Actual
+@@ -2,3 +2,3 @@
+  A: (string) (len=11) "some string",
+- B: (int) 10
++ B: (int) 15
+ }
+`
+
+	actual = diff(
